KeepPAM bundled runtime (on-prem)

This distribution may include third-party components as KeepPAM runtime,
not as a separate vendor product the customer must license from us:

- PostgreSQL (metadata)
- Redis (sessions / pubsub)
- Apache Guacamole guacd (KeepPAM Session Gateway)
- Tesseract OCR via guacenc helper (KeepPAM OCR)
- OpenSearch + Dashboards (KeepPAM Search, optional stand)
- Prometheus, Grafana, Tempo, OpenTelemetry Collector (observability stand)
- HAProxy (HA edge, optional)
- NATS (optional SIEM transport)
- Alpine / curl images (ops helpers)

First-party images: deploy-api / keeppam-web / keeppam-guacenc /
keeppam-firewall-probe / keeppam-iso-browser.

See docs/offline-update.txt and docs/kp.txt (T-03).
